<p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.6;">
  Card {{position}} of {{cardCount}} of <strong>{{editionTitle}}</strong> by <a href="{{artistUrl}}" style="color:#18181b;"><strong>{{artistName}}</strong></a> was mailed today to {{recipientName}}.
  {{#if expectedDelivery}}It should arrive around <strong style="color:#18181b;">{{expectedDelivery}}</strong>.{{else}}It should arrive within about a week.{{/if}}
</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0;">
  <a href="{{accountUrl}}" style="color:#18181b;">See your collections</a>
</p>
